          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge Solomo wakananga bakashi ba bende ba bungi, basangisha ne muana mukashi wa Palô; bakashi ba Bena Moaba ne ba Bena Amona ne ba Bena Edome ne ba Bena Sidona ne ba Bena Hiti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakadi ba mu bisamba bakambila Yehowa Bena Isalele ne, Kanubuelakanyi nʼabo, ne bobo kabalu kunudi nansha, bualu bua bobo nebakudimushe mitshima yenu bua kulonda nzambi yabo; Solomo wakalamata bakashi aba mu dinanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakadi ne bakashi nkama muanda mutekete, bana ba bakelenge ne bakashi bahika bakabakeye nkama isatu; bakashi bandi bakakudimusha mutshima wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua hakalua Solomo muntu mununu, bakashi bandi bakakudimusha mutshima wandi bua kulondeye nzambi mikuabo; mutshima wandi kawakadi muakane ku mesu kua Yehowa, Nzambi wandi, bu muakadi mutshima wa Davidi, tatu wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua Solomo wakalonda Bashetelota, nzambi mukashi wa Bena Sidona, ne Milekoma, bundu bua Bena Amona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomo Wakenza malu mabi ku mesu kua Yehowa; yeye kakatamba kunanukila kulonda Yehowa bu muakenza Davidi, tatu wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe, Solomo wakashila Kemosha, bundu bua Bena Moaba, tshitendelelu ha mutu ha mukuna udi ku mpala kua Yelushalema, ne tshia Moleke, bundu bua Bena Amona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakenzela bakashi bandi ba bende diatshimue, bakadi boshila nzambi yabo musenga wa manananshi ne bakayishihela nyama kabidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakadi ne Solomo tshiji, bualu bua mutshima wandi wakumuka kudi Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, nguakamueneka kudiye misangu ibidi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nguakamuambila bualu ebu mene mene bua yeye kalondi nzambi mikuabo; kadi yeye kakenza muakamba Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakambila Solomo ne, Bualu bua wewe wakatamba kuenza nunku, kuakatumikila tshihungidi tshietu ne mei anyi binakukuambila, bulelela, nenunyenge bukelenge, nembuhe muntu webe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi tshiena ngenza bualu ebu mu matuku ebe, bualu bua Davidi tatu webe; kadi nembunyenge mu bianza bia muanʼebe mulume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi tshiena nkunyenga bukelenge buonso nansha, nempe muana webe tshisamba tshimue bualu bua Davidi, muntu wanyi, ne bua Yelushalema unakusungula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakabisha Solomo muena lukuna, dina diandi Hadada, Muena Edome: wakadi muana wa mukelenge wa Bena Edome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua hakadi Davidi mu Edome, ne hakaya Yoaba, kapitene ka masalayi, bua kujikeye bantu bafue, bakashihabo mulume yonso mu Edome ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(bualu bua Yoaba ne Bena Isalele bonso bakashalaku ngondo isambombo bua kushihabo balume ba Bena Edome bonso); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi Hadada ne bantu bakuabo ba tatu wandi bakanyemena mu Ejipitu; Hadada wakatshidi muana mukese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakahitshila mu buloba bua Midiyana, bakafika ku Palana; bakangata bantu ba mu Palana, bakafika nʼabo mu buloba bua Ejipitu ku mesu kua Palô, mukelenge wa Ejipitu; yeye wakamuha nsubu ne bintu bia kudia ne madimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadada wakasangana luse lunene ku mesu kua Palô, wakamuha bukonde buandi bu mukashi wandi, yeye wakadi muanʼabo ne Tapenese, mukelenge mukashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muanʼabo ne Tapenese wakamulelela muana mulume dina diandi Genubata; Tapenese wakamujidike mabele mu nsubu wa Palô; Genubata wakadi mu nsubu wa Palô munkatshi mua bana bandi ba balume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakunvua Hadada lumu mu Ejipitu ne, Davidi wakalala tulu ne bankambua bandi, ne Yoaba, kapitene ka masalayi andi, wakafua, Hadada wakambila Palô ne, Witabushe bua meme kumuka bua kuhingana ku buloba buanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Palô wakamuebesha ne, Wakadi ne tshintu kai bualu hawakashikama nʼanyi bua wewe udi musue kuhingana ku buloba buebe? Yeye wakamukudimuna ne, Nansha tshintu; kadi anji kuitabusha bua meme kuya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi wakalambishila muena lukuna mukuabo, dina diandi Lesona, muana wa Eliada, wakanyema kudi mukelenge wandi Hadadezê, mukelenge wa mu Soba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakadisangisha bantu kudiye, wakalua kapitene kabo, bakabashiha Davidi mu Soha; hashishe, bakaya ku Damaseke, bakashikamamu, ne yeye wakakokesha mu Damaseke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakadi muena lukuna wa Bena Isalele matuku onso a Solomo; wakabenzela malu mabi ba mutu ha malu akabenzela Hadada; yeye wakalengulula Bena Isalele, wakakokesha mu Sulia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yalobama, muana wa Nebata, Muena Efelayima wa mu Zeleda, wakadi muntu wa Solomo, ne mamu wandi wakadi Seluya, mukashi wa mu lufuila, wakatombokela mukelenge kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebu mbualu buakatombokeleye mukelenge: Solomo wakasa musoko wa Milo, wakalongolola lumbu lua ku musoko wa Davidi, tatu wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu eu Yalobama wakadi muntu mukole wa bukitu; Solomo wakatangila ne, Nsongalume eu udi unanukila mu mudimu wandi, nunku wakamuteka ku mutu kua bena mudimu bonso ba mu Bena Yosefe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu matuku äu hakumuka Yalobama mu Yelushalema, Ahiya muprofete, Muena Shilo, wakamusangana mu nshila; Ahiya wakadi muluate tshilulu tshihia-tshihia; bubidi buabo bakadi ha nkayabo mu tshisuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahiya wakangata tshilulu tshihia-tshihia tshiakadiye nʼatshi, wakatshihandulula bihese dikumi ne tubidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakambila Yalobama ne, Angata bihese dikumi, bualu bua Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, udi wamba ne, Mona, nenyenge bukelenge mu bianza bia Solomo, nenkuhe wewe bisamba dikumi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(kadi yeye neikale ne tshisamba tshimue bualu bua Davidi, muntu wanyi, ne tshikuabo bua Yelushalema, musoko unakasungula munkatshi mua bisamba bionso bia Bena Isalele), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bualu bua bobo bakundekela, bakutendelela Bashetoleta, nzambi mukashi wa Bena Sidona, ne Kemosha, nzambi wa Bena Moaba, ne Milekoma, nzambi wa Bena Amona; kabakuenda mu nshila yanyi, bua kuenzabo malu adi mimpe ku mesu kuanyi ne bua kutumikilabo mei anyi ne mikenji yanyi bu muakenza Davidi tatu wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi tshiena nyenga bukelenge buonso mu bianza biandi: nemmuvuishe mukelenge matuku andi onso bualu bua Davidi, muntu wanyi unakasungula, nuakatumikila mikenji yanyi ne mei anyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi nenyenge bukelenge mu bianza bia muanʼandi mulume, nembufile kûdi, mbisamba dikumi mene mene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nempe muanʼandi tshisamba tshimue, bua Davidi, muntu wanyi ikale ne muinda utema ku mesu kuanyi mu Yelushalema matuku onso, musoko unakasungula bua kutekamu dina dianyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenkusungile, bua wewe kukokesha bantu bu mudi mutshima webe musue; wewe newikale mukelenge wa Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biunvua mei onso andi nkuambila, biwenda mu nshila yanyi bua kuenza malu adi mimpe ku mesu kuanyi, ne hua kutumikila mei anyi ne mikenji yanyi bu muakenza muntu wanyi Davidi, nengikale nʼebe, nenjadike tshiota tshiebe bulelela, bu munakajadika tshiota tshia Davidi; nenkuhe wewe Bena Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua bualu ebu nenkengeshe bana ba Davidi; kadi tshiena mbakengesha tshiendelele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomo wakakeba mua kushiha Yalobama, kadi Yalobama wakumuka ne wakanyemena mu Ejipitu kudi Shishaka, mukelenge wa Ejipitu; wakashala mu Ejipitu tô ne hakafua Solomo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bienzedi bikuabo bia Solomo ne malu onso akenzeye ne meji andi kabiena bifunda mu mukanda wa bienzedi bia Solomo, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomo wakakokesha Bena Isalele bonso mu Yelushalema bidimu makumi anai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomo wakalala tulu ne bankambua bandi, wakajikibua mu musoko wa Davidi, tatu wandi; Lehabama, muanʼandi wa balume, wakakokesha mu muaba wandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
